<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop halts Nordenham plant until late-Jan.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop halts Nordenham plant until late-Jan.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metals firm Metaleurop said on Thursday it had halted production at its Nordenham lead smelter in Germany at the end of 1996 until the last week of January.</p>
<p>The shutdown is for technical adjustments and partial repairs, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
